oai-macos-arm64

This repository contains patches, configuration files, shell scripts and
documentation for building and running the OpenAirInterface (Duranta) gNB
and nrUE on macOS with Apple Silicon. It does not contain or redistribute
the OpenAirInterface source tree or any binaries built from it.

