Tools the port depends on, none of them included here:
  asn1c, https://github.com/mouse07410/asn1c, BSD-2-Clause, at the commit
  OpenAirInterface pins (940dd5fa9f3917913fd487b13dfddfacd0ded06e).
  SIMDe, https://github.com/simd-everywhere/simde-no-tests, MIT, at the
  commit OpenAirInterface pins (1c68d9ad60bf63f3fb527c4ee3b2319d828ffcc6).
