  libsctp-compat, https://github.com/AndreiGosman/libsctp-compat-macos-arm64,
  LGPL-2.1-or-later, v0.4.1 or later.

The test subscriber values (PLMN 001/01, IMSI 001010000000001, the K and OPc
strings in config/ue.conf) are the public test vectors from the Open5GS
documentation, not secrets.

